ce Hamlet of Denmark is plunged into grief and rage after his father\u2019s sudden death and his mother\u2019s hasty remarriage to his uncle, Claudius, who has seized the throne. When the ghost of his father reveals that he was murdered by Claudius, Hamlet vows revenge but becomes paralyzed by indecision and existential doubt, feigning madness to investigate the truth. His erratic behavior alienates his love interest, Ophelia, and leads to a series of tragic misunderstandings, culminating in Hamlet accidentally killing her father, Polonius, which drives Ophelia to madness and suicide. As political tensions rise,", "tool_calls": null, "reasoning": null, "tokens": ["Prince", " Ham", "let", " of", " Denmark", " is", " plunged", " into", " grief", " and", " rage", " after", " his", " father", "\u2019s", " sudden", " death", " and", " his", " mother", "\u2019s", " h", "asty", " remar", "riage", " to", " his", " uncle", ",", " Claud", "ius", ",", " who", " has", " seized", " the", " throne", ".", " When", " the", " ghost", " of", " his", " father", " reveals", " that", " he", " was", " murdered", " by", " Claud", "ius", ",", " Ham", "let", " vows", " revenge", " but", " becomes", " paralyzed", " by", " inde", "cision", " and", " existential", " doubt", ",", " fe", "ign", "ing", " madness", " to", " investigate", " the", " truth", ".", " His", " erratic", " behavior", " alien", "ates", " his", " love", " interest", ",", " O", "ph", "elia", ",", " and", " leads", " to", " a", " series", " of", " tragic", " misunderstand", "ings", ",", " cul", "minating", " in", " Ham", "let", " accidentally", " killing", " her", " father", ",", " Pol", "on", "ius", ",", " which", " drives", " O", "ph", "elia", " to", " madness", " and", " suicide", ".", " As", " political", " tensions", " rise", ","]}, {"i": 9, "content": "```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"The Great Gatsby\",\n  \"author\": \"F. Scott Fitzgerald\",\n  \"year\": 1925,\n  \"tags\": [\"classic\", \"fiction\", \"american literature\",